elvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Meta开源30B稠密多模态模型Muse Glimmer，支持本地化部署</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Anthropic 全球范围内为 Claude 全系产品嵌入隐形水印与 C2PA 溯源标识</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">谷歌 Gemini 独立应用月活突破10亿，成为谷歌第14款十亿级产品</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/8c5574c883415011ed11df2ffc9ec05d.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">谷歌 CEO 桑达尔·皮查伊于2026年8月11日宣布，Gemini 独立应用月活跃用户数（MAU）正式突破10亿大关，成为谷歌历史上增长最快的产品。该数据仅统计独立应用，不含 Google 搜索 AI 模式等渠道。此前在2026年 Q2 财报中，该应用月活已达9.5亿，且在 iOS 平台活跃用户已超1亿。用户交互呈现高频特征，63% 的用户通过语音沟通，系统日均生成图片超1.5亿张。谷歌通过 Gemini 3.5 Flash 等优化模型提升代码与 Agent 任务能力，并计划在“Made by Google”发布会上将 Gemini 架构深度集成至新一代 Pixel 硬件。此次里程碑标志着 Gemini 与 ChatGPT 在用户规模上进入平起平坐阶段，AI 市场竞争重心正加速向入口控制力与场景留存率倾斜。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">英伟达正加码开发新一代开源AI模型Nemotron 4，参数规模将达万亿级</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/bed78301d8259252ffea81705af96e3a.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">英伟达正在研发新一代开源人工智能模型Nemotron 4，其参数规模预计将至少达到1万亿级别。该项目旨在通过提升模型性能正面迎战全球顶尖开源大模型，进一步扩大英伟达在开源AI生态中的影响力，并持续拉动市场对高性能GPU算力的需求。英伟达此前已推出Nemotron-4 340B系列模型，广泛应用于大语言模型训练数据生成、核心模型开发及企业级AI应用落地。行业分析认为，随着模型调用成本降低，企业试错门槛显著下降，开发者能在既定预算内进行更大规模的用户测试与产品迭代。这一技术进展预计将有效催化多元化AI落地场景的渗透，推动AI应用迎来关键发展拐点。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Meta开源30B稠密多模态模型Muse Glimmer，支持本地化部署</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/a32dfb79f40f3ed73e377d63b42b5bce.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Meta正式发布并开源30B参数的稠密多模态模型Muse Glimmer，采用Apache 2.0许可证。该模型专为本地智能体工作流优化，具备强大的文本处理、视觉能力及复杂多步推理与工具调用表现。在硬件适配上，通过4-bit量化可将体积压缩至20GB以下，适配24GB或32GB显存的消费级GPU或Mac终端。结合DFlash块级投机解码技术，该模型在RTX 5090等硬件上实现了显著的吞吐量提升。在MCP Atlas等基准测试中，Muse Glimmer表现领先。Meta创始人扎克伯格重申开源路线，并预告基础模型Muse Spark 1.2的权重将于未来几周内开放。此次发布为开发者提供了高效的本地化部署方案，进一步推动了开源生态在终端侧的应用落地。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Anthropic 全球范围内为 Claude 全系产品嵌入隐形水印与 C2PA 溯源标识</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/b71cbb1ef0b58e51f834cbf694c2fb5b.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Anthropic 宣布自 2026 年 8 月起，全球范围内所有新发布的 Claude 模型将强制嵌入内容标识，覆盖 API、Claude、Claude Code、Claude Cowork 及 Claude Tag 等全产品线。针对文本输出，Anthropic 采用不影响可读性的隐形水印技术，该水印在复制粘贴及部分编辑后仍可保留；针对图像等文件，则基于 C2PA 开放标准附加数字签名元数据，以揭示处理痕迹及后续篡改行为。该功能将通过 AWS、Google Cloud 和 Microsoft Foundry 等云合作伙伴同步生效。Anthropic 明确指出，水印检测存在固有局限，检测到水印不代表内容完全由 AI 生成，未检测到也不排除 AI 参与。此举旨在应对 AI 生成内容泛滥及深度伪造风险，通过建立可信</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
